# The administrator of a box's own Infisical is NOT set here. It is generated
# when the box is initialized and kept in that box's escrow, which Day-0 reads
# it from (ADR-076).
#
# The organisation NAME is not a credential: it is a label inside the box's own
# Infisical, the same on every box by design.
SECRET_STORE_ORG_NAME=
